UID:upstream-creative-writers-grassroots-journalism-residency-2026@artifici
 alnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260902T121745Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260707
SUMMARY:Deadline: Upstream Creative Writers / Grassroots Journalism Residen
 cy 2026: Writing About Natural Places\, Stewards\, and the Spaces We Care 
 For
DESCRIPTION:The Upstream Creative Writers / Grassroots Journalism Residency
  invites creative writers\, poets\, storytellers and grassroots journalist
 s to spend intentional time over nine months exploring Minnesota's parks\,
  waterways\, forests and natural places\, and the people who care for them
 . The residency seeks writers who care about storytelling rooted in place\
 , environment\, community\, stewardship and connection. SELECTED MINNESOTA
  ARTISTS RECEIVE: a USD 3\,000 artist stipend\; mileage reimbursement up t
 o USD 500\; a Minnesota State Parks Pass\; mentorship and creative support
 \; and the opportunity to publish and share their work statewide. ELIGIBIL
 ITY: applicants must be a Minnesota resident\, 18 years or older\, with a 
 residence in East Side St Paul\; West Central Minnesota (Becker\, Clay\, D
 ouglas\, Grant\, Otter Tail\, Pope\, Stevens\, Traverse\, and Wilkin Count
 ies)\; or the Iron Range\, Minnesota (Aitkin\, Carlton\, Cook\, Itasca\, K
 oochiching\, Lake\, and Saint Louis Counties). Applications open 8 June 20
 26\; deadline 6 July 2026 by 11:59pm. Apply via the online JotForm.\n\nOrg
 anisation: Upstream\nLocation: Remote residency in Minnesota\, USA\; appli
 cants must be Minnesota residents living in East Side St Paul\; West Centr
 al Minnesota (Becker\, Clay\, Douglas\, Grant\, Otter Tail\, Pope\, Steven
 s\, Traverse\, and Wilkin Counties)\; or the Iron Range (Aitkin\, Carlton\
 , Cook\, Itasca\, Koochiching\, Lake\, and Saint Louis Counties).\nAward: 
 USD 3\,000 artist stipend\, plus mileage reimbursement up to USD 500\, a M
 innesota State Parks Pass\, mentorship and creative support\, and the oppo
 rtunity to publish and share work statewide. No application fee.\nDuration
 : 9-month remote residency\n\nMore: https://form.jotform.com/2614629664421
 60?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://form.jotform.com/261462966442160?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote residency in Minnesota\, USA\; applicants must be Minnesota
  residents living in East Side St Paul\; West Central Minnesota (Becker\, 
 Clay\, Douglas\, Grant\, Otter Tail\, Pope\, Stevens\, Traverse\, and Wilk
 in Counties)\; or the Iron Range (Aitkin\, Carlton\, Cook\, Itasca\, Kooch
 iching\, Lake\, and Saint Louis Counties).
END:VEVENT
