SUMMARY:Deadline: Amplify Arts: 2027 Fellowship (Omaha/Council Bluffs\, the
 me Migration)
DESCRIPTION:Amplify Arts' Fellowship champions artists working outside conv
 entional art spaces to investigate the civic histories\, cultural traditio
 ns\, and living ecologies that shape the Omaha region. It supports site-re
 sponsive installations\, book and publishing projects\, films\, performanc
 es\, and other publicly engaged project-based work with USD 10\,000 in pro
 ject support\, individualized mentorship\, and feedback in a small cohort.
  For the 2027 Fellowship\, preference goes to projects engaging the theme 
 of Migration: movement of people\, but also the circulation of ideas\, lan
 guages\, labor\, waterways\, seeds\, species\, capital\, and culture. Proj
 ects that invite public participation are especially encouraged. ELIGIBILI
 TY: artists aged 19+ living in the Omaha/Council Bluffs metro area\; colle
 ctives with a significant collaborative history may apply\; no formal educ
 ation required. APPLICATION via Submittable: artist statement\, project de
 scription\, project budget\, work sample\, and works cited page. TIMELINE:
  applications open 31 August to 4 October 2026\; info session 9 September\
 ; interviews 19-23 October\; results 30 October 2026. The fellowship year 
 runs January 2027 to January 2028.\n\nOrganisation: Amplify Arts\nLocation
 : Omaha\, Nebraska\, USA. Applicants must be 19+ and live in the Omaha/Cou
 ncil Bluffs metro area (Washington\, Douglas\, Cass\, Sarpy\, and Saunders
  counties in Nebraska\; Pottawattamie\, Mills\, and Harrison counties in I
 owa).\nAward: USD 10\,000 in project support per fellowship\, plus individ
 ualized project mentorship and a small cohort-based learning environment. 
 Up to three artists or collectives are selected. No application fee.\nDura
 tion: One year\, January 2027 to January 2028.\n\nMore: https://www.amplif
 yarts.org/events-blog/2027-fellowship?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.amplifyarts.org/events-blog/2027-fellowship?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Omaha\, Nebraska\, USA. Applicants must be 19+ and live in the Oma
 ha/Council Bluffs metro area (Washington\, Douglas\, Cass\, Sarpy\, and Sa
 unders counties in Nebraska\; Pottawattamie\, Mills\, and Harrison countie
 s in Iowa).
