 tion Fellowship Program: USD 10\,000 for 10-week graduate student fellows\
 ; USD 45\,000/year predoctoral\; USD 57\,000/year postdoctoral and senior 
 (prorated under 12 months). Betsy James Wyeth Fellowship in Native America
 n Art: USD 53\,000. Plus a research allowance of up to USD 5\,000 for shor
 t research trips and a USD 100-1\,000 relocation travel allowance. No appl
